Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.95,0:03:09.40,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}這裡沒人想看到你的臉 聽到你出聲
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.40,0:03:11.61,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}你是覺得自己一直在贏
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:13.72,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord2\blur5\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1045,1115,1045)\c&HFFFFFF&}但惡魔馬上就會來見你
